{"id": "main_v2_Q38", "raw_id": 38, "set": "main_v2", "type": "multi_hop_retrieval", "hops": 3, "leakage_risk": "LOW", "question": "If a receiver returns HTTP 429 for an outbound webhook, what happens next in this system?", "expected_answer": "The dispatcher treats 429 as retryable, so the worker marks the job failed and reschedules it with backoff unless it has already exhausted maxAttempts.", "agent_id": null, "created_at": "2026-03-29T20:32:10.357169+00:00", "model_answer": null, "error": "400 Client Error: Bad Request for url: https://api.cursor.com/v0/agents"}
